**Please ensure you adhere to every item in this list.**

+ The PR title is formatted as follows: `applications/crossbar: improve some behavior`
 + The application or module name goes before the colon
 + If the PR impacts multiple applications or modules, pick the dominant one
 + If the PR impacts the project as a whole (e.g., updates to GitHub workflow changes, updates
   to code formatting, etc.), use "openkazoo" instead of an application or module
 + The part after the colon uses the verb phrase that completes the blank in,
   "This change modifies Kazoo to ___________"
 + Lowercase verb after the colon
 + No trailing period
 + Keep the title as short as possible, ideally under 76 characters
+ Keep this PR description focused on context, rationale, and test evidence
+ If there is a corresponding issue, add either `Fixes #1234` or `Updates #1234`
 (the latter if this is not a complete fix)
+ Keep logs, traces, and screenshots relevant and redact sensitive data
+ Delete these instructions once you have read and applied them
